    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viking Fish is an idle fishing game that docks at the bottom of your screen, allowing you to manage your Vikings while attending to other tasks.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/b61aad64a6fd2339a9ef19353441d2c9.poster.avif?t=1728301439\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/b61aad64a6fd2339a9ef19353441d2c9.webm?t=1728301439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/b61aad64a6fd2339a9ef19353441d2c9.mp4?t=1728301439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your Vikings cycle through an endless loop of casting, fishing, reeling in, and resting. Each time they reel in an item, it belongs to one of three categories: junk, fish, or treasure. Each category has two levels of rarity, rewarding the following coins:</i> </p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Junk (Common):</strong> 30 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Junk (Uncommon):</strong> 100 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Fish (Rare):</strong> 500 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Fish (Epic):</strong> 2,500 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Treasure (Legendary):</strong> 10,000 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Treasure (Mythic):</strong> 25,000 coins</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Coins are used to unlock new Vikings, allowing you to fish for more items faster. Vikings can also be upgraded to:</i> </p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Decrease the chance of finding junk <br></li><li>Increase the chance of finding treasure <br></li><li>Reduce resting time <br></li><li>Increase fishing speed</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/8e86617b8d1bc75ac079718040c5e16d.poster.avif?t=1728301439\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/8e86617b8d1bc75ac079718040c5e16d.webm?t=1728301439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/8e86617b8d1bc75ac079718040c5e16d.mp4?t=1728301439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The stats tab keeps track of your progress and lifetime achievements, including:</strong></p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Total coins earned<br></li><li>Total items fished<br></li><li>Total junk, fish, and treasure items fished<br></li><li>Detailed records for each individual item, showing how many times it has been fished</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hovering over any item will display a tooltip with additional information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 100 unique items to fish for and a wide range of achievements to unlock, Viking Fish offers a rich and rewarding idle experience.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viking Fish is an idle fishing game that docks at the bottom of your screen, allowing you to manage your Vikings while attending to other tasks.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/b61aad64a6fd2339a9ef19353441d2c9.poster.avif?t=1728301439\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/b61aad64a6fd2339a9ef19353441d2c9.webm?t=1728301439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/b61aad64a6fd2339a9ef19353441d2c9.mp4?t=1728301439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your Vikings cycle through an endless loop of casting, fishing, reeling in, and resting. Each time they reel in an item, it belongs to one of three categories: junk, fish, or treasure. Each category has two levels of rarity, rewarding the following coins:</i> </p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Junk (Common):</strong> 30 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Junk (Uncommon):</strong> 100 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Fish (Rare):</strong> 500 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Fish (Epic):</strong> 2,500 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Treasure (Legendary):</strong> 10,000 coins  <br></li><li><strong>Treasure (Mythic):</strong> 25,000 coins</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Coins are used to unlock new Vikings, allowing you to fish for more items faster. Vikings can also be upgraded to:</i> </p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Decrease the chance of finding junk <br></li><li>Increase the chance of finding treasure <br></li><li>Reduce resting time <br></li><li>Increase fishing speed</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/8e86617b8d1bc75ac079718040c5e16d.poster.avif?t=1728301439\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/8e86617b8d1bc75ac079718040c5e16d.webm?t=1728301439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986650/extras/8e86617b8d1bc75ac079718040c5e16d.mp4?t=1728301439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The stats tab keeps track of your progress and lifetime achievements, including:</strong></p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Total coins earned<br></li><li>Total items fished<br></li><li>Total junk, fish, and treasure items fished<br></li><li>Detailed records for each individual item, showing how many times it has been fished</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hovering over any item will display a tooltip with additional information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 100 unique items to fish for and a wide range of achievements to unlock, Viking Fish offers a rich and rewarding idle experience.</strong></p>",
